zumir bundles MIR, a lightweight JIT compiler, with its C compiler c2mir,
under src/vendor/mir/:
https://github.com/vnmakarov/mir at commit
dc2c763f1c8bc746102ce87933d866335f9e6c06, with the local patches listed in
src/vendor/PROVENANCE.

